<title>USA: Rhone-Poulenc Rorer panel to review holders' plan.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer panel to review holders' plan.</headline>
<dateline>COLLEGEVILLE, Pa. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc said Wednesday it has formed a special committee of three independent directors to review the $4.3-billion proposal by Rhone-Poulenc SA to raise its stake.</p>
<p>The U.S. pharmaceutical company said it formed the committee in response to a proposal by its French parent to buy all the outstanding shares of Rhone-Poulenc Rorer it does not already own. Rhone-Poulenc SA currently owns a 68.3 percent stake in the U.S. company.</p>
</text>
